    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="0432" n="316" xml:id="pg316"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 887.0112/12.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 390.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 21, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge receipt of
                    the Department’s instruction No. 123 of the 13th instant, instructing me as to
                    the reply to be made to President Gómez’s note of the 19th ultimo in regard to
                    the proposed Zapata Swamp Concession.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to report that I yesterday addressed a note to
                    President Gómez in the language desired by the Department.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hugh S. Gibson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
